ange=\"added\">JDBC · nightly</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"lake\" data-to=\"sas\" data-change=\"added\">Trino</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"xls\" data-to=\"sas\" data-line=\"dashed\" data-change=\"removed\">XLSX by mail</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"lake\" data-to=\"site\" data-change=\"added\">publish</li>\n    <li class=\"diagram-edge\" data-from=\"sas\" data-to=\"api\" data-change=\"added\">feeds</li>\n  </ol>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"State, interactive","html":"<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-state-live\" data-diagram-action=\"prev\"\n    >Previous</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-state-live\" data-diagram-action=\"next\"\n    >Next</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-state-live\" data-diagram-action=\"clear\"\n    >Clear</button\n  >\n  <output class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-state-live\"\n    >Click a box or an arrow - or press Next.</output\n  >\n</div>\n<figure class=\"diagram\" id=\"dg-state-live\" data-interactive data-type=\"state\" aria-label=\"Order state machine\">\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">State machine</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">An order, from cart to delivery</span>\n  </figcaption>\n  <div\n    class=\"diagram-canvas\"\n    style=\"\n      --cols: 5;\n      grid-template-columns: 2.5rem repeat(4, minmax(7.5rem, 1fr));\n      --diagram-node-w: 8rem;\n      --diagram-gap-x: 3.25rem;\n    \"\n  >\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"s0\" data-shape=\"start\" style=\"--col: 1; --row: 1\"\n      ><span class=\"diagram-node-name\">new</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"cart\" style=\"--col: 2; --row: 1\"\n 